      "text": "> :INFO:\n>\n> `menu-disabled` disables an item visually.\n> To disable a `<button>` add a `disabled` attribute.\n> To disable a `<a>`, remove the `href` attribute and add `role=\"link\" aria-disabled=\"true\"` attributes.",
